Apple //e core: vendored from NanoApple2.

No Apple ROM content is in this directory or anywhere in the repository, the CI artefacts or a .cor (tools/check_no_roms.sh
checks it): the system ROM, the character ROM, the Disk II boot ROM and the AppleMouse card ROMs are written by the
application through the DMA window from files on the stick (core.toml `roms`, names only).

Licence position: the machine logic (apple2.vhd, timing_generator.vhd, video_generator.vhd, disk_ii.vhd, drive_ii.vhd)
carries only credit lines, no licence text in the file (Szombathelyi Gyorgy, based on Stephen A. Edwards' Apple ][+,
Columbia University); the repository NanoApple2 declares GPL v3 as a whole (its LICENSE). We treat the files as GPL v3 as
declared by the repository and keep the credit lines in every file.
Rights holders who see a problem with any part listed here: please contact us, and we remove the part concerned.

